{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a world where food falls from the sky and your survival depends on what you eat and how fast you eat it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble up 100 foods to unlock the phase exit, or take a risk and aim for 150 to earn a five-star score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the calories of each item, your character will gain or lose weight. Reach either extreme and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat wisely and act fast before you're swallowed by the rising tide of food, leftovers from what you skip or can't reach in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple gameplay, tasty challenge!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with keyboard and controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, text-free interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 levels with progressive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 different foods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music and environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your calorie intuition and lightning reflexes. Can you maintain the perfect weight, dodge the food flood, and become the star of the feast?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969120?t=1757000843","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3969120?t=1757000843","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969120/9ff6f4f927df7f477b222d3e37315b2e37a13782/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757000843","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969120/9ff6f4f927df7f477b222d3e37315b2e37a13782/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757000843","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to a world where food falls from the sky and your survival depends on what you eat and how fast you eat it!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble up 100 foods to unlock the phase exit, or take a risk and aim for 150 to earn a five-star score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Depending on the calories of each item, your character will gain or lose weight. Reach either extreme and it's game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat wisely and act fast before you're swallowed by the rising tide of food, leftovers from what you skip or can't reach in time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Simple gameplay, tasty challenge!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compatible with keyboard and controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Minimalist, text-free interface</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 levels with progressive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 100 different foods!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic music and environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready for the challenge?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your calorie intuition and lightning reflexes. Can you maintain the perfect weight, dodge the food flood, and become the star of the feast?</p>","developers":["Chispa Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3969120/952d779eae963414452116ae448b106f6aadeec7/header.jpg?t=1757000843","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","r